5\u09be\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09c7\u09b0 \u0998\u099f\u09a8\u09be \u0998\u099f\u09b2...\n\u09ac\u09bf\u09b8\u09cd\u09a4\u09be\u09b0\u09bf\u09a4: https://t.co/zTOInrOhrF\n\n#KolkataPandalFire #NehruColony #DurgaPuja2026 #eisamayonline #EiSamay https://t.co/PodaEyf8I1", "url": "https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2112262584212869263"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 5235, "like_count": 129, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112233807814537217", "3_2112233807818719232"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:25:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112233816224088460"], "id": "2112233816224088460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83c\udfc6 Another proud moment for NISHAAN!\n\nManiktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja 2026 wins \u201c\u09b8\u09c7\u09b0\u09be \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u201d at Pratidin Pujo Perfect! \ud83c\udf3a\n\nCongratulations to theme artist Aditi Chakraborty!\n\n84 Years of Heritage. One Unforgettable NISHAAN. \u2764\ufe0f\n\n#NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/VEAIj78djo", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112233816224088460"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112205696859320320", "3_2112205735413379072", "3_2112205788664225792"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T15:34:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112205825418904014"], "id": "2112205825418904014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 34, "impression_count": 35440, "like_count": 542, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 37, "retweet_count": 95}, "text": "This is Shyambazar 5 Point Crossing at around 9PM on Maha Ashtami.\n\nIf this is normal for you, then you're most likely a BJP dalal or just plain blind.\n\nPuja vibes were already missing, due to BJP. Chorebagan killed whatever little we had. https://t.co/qCqBrxC8Yn https://t.co/vVyvSBSQyH", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112205825418904014"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112141572435582976", "3_2112141604094115840", "3_2112141641100431360"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-19T11:19:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112141668124344383"], "id": "2112141668124344383", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Durga Puja at Deshapriya Park is organized by the Deshapriya Park Durgotsab Samity (also historically associated or referred to under names like Ballygunge Sarbojanin Durgotsab Samity / Deshapriya Park Sarbojanin). Established in 1938 https://t.co/EJRWzxwkQr", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2112141668124344383"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112126853356126208"]}, "author_id": "1910747325590331393", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:25:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112127903517532355"], "id": "2112127903517532355", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 751, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Fire at Uttarakhand\u2019s Adi Badri Maa Bhagwati Temple, a stampede at Kolkata\u2019s Chorebagan puja mandap and now a sudden epiphany of Maa shedding tears of grief during Maha Ashtami\nThings to come not looking good at all!\ud83d\ude30\ud83d\ude25 https://t.co/Yu9KTeNCde", "url": "https://x.com/LancerFlying/status/2112127903517532355"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112112695759732736"]}, "author_id": "819130177", "created_at": "2026-10-19T09:24:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112112739644854658"], "id": "2112112739644854658", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 286, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kolkata Durga Puja 2026 | Chorbagan Sarbojanin Stampede Case UPDATES | Postmortem Reports | \u09b8\u09be\u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u098f\u09b2 \u099a\u09cb\u09b0\u09ac\u09be\u0997\u09be\u09a8 \u0995\u09be\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09c7 \u09ae\u09c3\u09a4\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ae\u09af\u09bc\u09a8\u09be\u09a4\u09a6\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u0986\u09b0\u0993 \u0986\u09aa\u09a1\u09c7\u099f\u0964\n\n\u09ac\u09bf\u09b8\u09cd\u09a4\u09be\u09b0\u09bf\u09a4: https://t.co/mFYPz5yu2u\n\n#Kolkata #DurgaPuja2026 #ChorbaganSarbojonin #EiSamay #EiSamayOnline https://t.co/0E0sQFZo2m", "url": "https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2112112739644854658"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112110742963159040"]}, "author_id": "2071488534675152896", "created_at": "2026-10-19T09:16:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112110752274546737"], "id": "2112110752274546737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#TheBongVoice: \u099a\u09cb\u09b0\u09ac\u09be\u0997\u09be\u09a8 \u0995\u09be\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09b0 \u09b8\u09a4\u09b0\u09cd\u0995 \u09b8\u09cd\u09ac\u09be\u09b8\u09cd\u09a5\u09cd\u09af\u09ad\u09ac\u09a8! \u09ac\u09a1\u09bc \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb \u09ae\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09aa\u09c7 \u099a\u09bf\u0995\u09bf\u09ce\u09b8\u0995, \u09ac\u09be\u09a4\u09bf\u09b2 \u0995\u09b0\u09cd\u09ae\u09c0-\u0986\u09a7\u09bf\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09bf\u0995\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u099b\u09c1\u099f\u09bf\n.\n.\n.\n#ChorbaganInciden